schema_version: relay-v3.1-ep
id: EP-ISS201-EXAM-BANK-PASS1-V31-001
work_package: WP-ISS201-EXAM-BANK-PASS1
outcome:
  statement: 'Reconcile and deliver PR 202 as Pass 1 provenance-first competitive-exam
    question custody: accept only independently organizer-verified historical PYQ
    identities, quarantine unverifiable donors, preserve source-text custody by official
    locator, and produce audit artifacts without constructing practice sets/exams
    or widening learner curriculum scope.'
basis:
  predecessor_checkpoint: null
  material_base: bf20357037f2e9a916a4fa42ea83a075d6ed0351
  protocol_basis: reallaksh19/Common@1c168695f237a8bef184a9e189be80fab87d1e78:skills/engineering-pr-delivery-v3.1
  semantic_dependencies:
  - path: Shared/roles/CORE2.md
    reason: Learner-facing question provenance boundary.
  - path: Shared/roles/CORE2A.md
    reason: Core2 practice-role contract.
  - path: Shared/roles/CORE2B.md
    reason: Changed-demand / transfer-role contract.
  - path: Shared/library/package.schema.json
    reason: Shared canonical library contract; must remain unchanged.
  - path: Physics/library/phy-nlm-first-law.v1.json
    reason: Canonical Physics NLM bucket/capability/family resolution.
  - path: Physics/library/phy-kin-2d-motion.v1.json
    reason: Canonical Motion-in-Plane bucket/capability/family resolution.
  - path: Physics/library/relative-motion.v1.json
    reason: Canonical relative-motion references and explicit acquisition hold boundary.
scope:
  write:
  - .github/workflows/v3-relay.yml
  - Physics/library/exam-bank/competitive-exam-question-bank.v1.json
  - Chemistry/library/exam-bank/competitive-exam-question-bank.v1.json
  - docs/question-bank/pass1/source-acquisition-ledger.json
  - docs/question-bank/pass1/rejected-unverified-sources.md
  - docs/question-bank/pass1/coverage-matrix.md
  - docs/question-bank/pass1/concept-bucket-inventory.md
  - tests/test_competitive_exam_question_bank.py
  - docs/architecture-manifest.json
  read:
  - Shared/roles/**
  - Shared/library/**
  - Physics/library/**
  - Chemistry/library/**
  - public/physics/**
  - docs/question-bank/**
  - tests/**
  protect:
  - Learners/**
  - Mathematics/**
  - agents/relay/**
  - Shared/library/package.schema.json
  - Shared/publication_host/**
  - Shared/workbench/**
  - standalone/**
  prohibit:
  - Do not construct practice sets, mock exams, worksheets, or generated exam papers
    in Pass 1.
  - Do not add fully authored filler questions.
  - Do not promote SOURCE_UNVERIFIED donors to canonical learner-facing Core2.
  - Do not fabricate official exam identity, shift/session, source wording, answer-key
    authority, or organizer provenance.
  - Do not reproduce verbatim source text where the bank policy uses external-reference
    custody.
  - Do not add circular-motion content to this pass.
  - Do not convert Chemistry local concept proposals into a canonical Chemistry teaching
    package or shared schema change.
  - Do not fill the Motion-in-1D relative-motion hold without independently matched
    organizer evidence.
  - Do not reinterpret this custody pass as Grade-10/11, Mathematics, or learner-route
    expansion.
  - Do not merge without a fresh accepted checkpoint and explicit Owner MERGE authority.
acceptance:
- id: AC-201-SCOPE
  statement: 'Pass 1 contains question custody/audit only: no practice sets/exams,
    no authored filler, and no circular-motion additions.'
  evidence_requirements:
  - test: tests/test_competitive_exam_question_bank.py::CompetitiveExamQuestionBankTest::test_pass1_contains_no_authored_questions_or_generated_sets
  - test: tests/test_competitive_exam_question_bank.py::CompetitiveExamQuestionBankTest::test_scope_excludes_circular_motion_and_holds_unverified_1d_relative_motion
- id: AC-201-PROVENANCE
  statement: Exactly eight accepted canonical candidates are PYQ_VERIFIED and resolve
    to official organizer archive records while historical examination identities
    are preserved.
  evidence_requirements:
  - test: tests/test_competitive_exam_question_bank.py::CompetitiveExamQuestionBankTest::test_verified_question_source_refs_resolve_to_official_records
  - test: tests/test_competitive_exam_question_bank.py::CompetitiveExamQuestionBankTest::test_original_identifiers_are_complete_without_invented_shift_or_number
  - oracle: Official jeeadv.ac.in archive and cited paper locators independently spot-checked
      for 2007, 2008, 2011 and 2023 identities.
- id: AC-201-QUARANTINE
  statement: All 162 donor records remain SOURCE_UNVERIFIED / QUARANTINED_DONOR_ONLY;
    147 are in-scope and 15 are explicitly out-of-scope non-relative 1D donors.
  evidence_requirements:
  - test: tests/test_competitive_exam_question_bank.py::CompetitiveExamQuestionBankTest::test_provenance_classes_are_exact_and_unverified_is_not_promoted
  - test: tests/test_competitive_exam_question_bank.py::CompetitiveExamQuestionBankTest::test_donor_registries_are_preserved
- id: AC-201-TEXT-CUSTODY
  statement: Canonical records use organizer-locator custody rather than reconstructed
    verbatim source text, and independent reasoning is not misrepresented as source
    hints.
  evidence_requirements:
  - test: tests/test_competitive_exam_question_bank.py::CompetitiveExamQuestionBankTest::test_source_text_custody_is_locator_backed_and_not_a_reconstructed_original
- id: AC-201-RESOLUTION
  statement: Physics bucket/capability/family references resolve canonically; Chemistry
    identifiers remain namespaced local proposals pending a canonical Chemistry package,
    with no Shared schema change.
  evidence_requirements:
  - test: tests/test_competitive_exam_question_bank.py::CompetitiveExamQuestionBankTest::test_concept_bucket_capability_and_family_resolution
- id: AC-201-ANSWER
  statement: Accepted items carry explicit answer-verification evidence and do not
    infer correctness from an exam label.
  evidence_requirements:
  - test: tests/test_competitive_exam_question_bank.py::CompetitiveExamQuestionBankTest::test_answer_verification_is_present_and_never_exam_label_based
- id: AC-201-HOLD
  statement: Motion-in-1D relative-motion stays on acquisition hold because no organizer-hosted
    item was independently matched; no unverified donor is used to fill the gap.
  evidence_requirements:
  - test: tests/test_competitive_exam_question_bank.py::CompetitiveExamQuestionBankTest::test_scope_excludes_circular_motion_and_holds_unverified_1d_relative_motion
- id: AC-201-REPO
  statement: Repository guardrails pass and v31-relay validates against exact Common@1c168695f237a8bef184a9e189be80fab87d1e78
    on the exact PR head.
  evidence_requirements:
  - oracle: GitHub Actions guardrails + v31-relay on exact PR head.
quality_policy:
  level: STANDARD
  independent_review: OPTIONAL
admission_policy:
  qualification: NOT_REQUIRED
  question_policy: NONE
next:
  first_action: Treat current PR 202 bytes as the candidate; repin exact V3.1 validation,
    re-run provenance falsifiers and repository guardrails, then checkpoint without
    widening Pass 1.
  stop_conditions:
  - Stop if any accepted identity cannot be supported by organizer-hosted evidence.
  - Stop if quarantine or source-text custody would need weakening to make the candidate
    pass.
  - Stop if delivery requires practice-set/exam construction, learner-route expansion,
    or shared-schema changes.
  - Stop before merge without fresh checkpoint and explicit Owner MERGE authority.
